  "question": {
    "text": "In S<sub>N</sub>2 reactions, the correct order of reactivity for the following compounds :<br />\rCH<sub>3</sub>Cl, CH<sub>3</sub>CH<sub>2</sub>Cl, (CH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>2</sub>CHCl and (CH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>3</sub>CCl is :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "CH<sub>3</sub>Cl &gt; (CH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>2</sub>CHCl &gt; CH<sub>3</sub>CH<sub>2</sub>Cl &gt; (CH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>3</sub>CCl",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "CH<sub>3</sub>Cl &gt; CH<sub>3</sub>CH<sub>2</sub>Cl &gt; (CH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>2</sub>CHCl &gt; (CH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>3</sub>CCl",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "CH<sub>3</sub>CH<sub>2</sub>Cl &gt; CH<sub>3</sub>Cl &gt; (CH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>2</sub>CHCl &gt; (CH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>3</sub>CCl",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "(CH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>2</sub>CHCl &gt; CH<sub>3</sub>CH<sub>2</sub>Cl &gt; CH<sub>3</sub>Cl &gt; (CH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>3</sub>CCl",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mtext>S</mtext><mtext>N</mtext></msub><mtext>2</mtext></math>&nbsp;involves the formation of a pentavalent&nbsp;intermediate, and the reactivity depends on steric hindrance. Lesser the steric&nbsp;hindrance, more is the reactivity of <math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>S</mtext> <mtext>N</mtext> </msub> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </math>.<br /><br /><sup><u><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0149_26fdcc760649.jpg\" style=\"width: 591px; height: 111px;\" /></strong></u></sup></p>"
